  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/12/P1230520.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">(14 fotos) Carnicer&iacute;a Rub&eacute;n, en la calle del Carmen, junto al jard&iacute;n de Cervantes de Onda, ya est&aacute; preparada para la Navidad y ofrece cordero de primera calidad a 12,50&euro;/kilo, hasta el15 de diciembre, jamones de recebo y de jabugo, aceitunas, bacalao, quesos de todas clases, adem&aacute;s de turrones artesanos Barber&aacute; de Atzeneta.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenmartinezdesembre/p1230438.jpg\" alt=\"p1230438\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenmartinezdesembre/p1230441.jpg\" alt=\"p1230441\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenmartinezdesembre/p1230443.jpg\" alt=\"p1230443\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenmartinezdesembre/p1230446.jpg\" alt=\"p1230446\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenmartinezdesembre/p1230449.jpg\" alt=\"p1230449\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenmartinezdesembre/p1230451.jpg\" alt=\"p1230451\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenmartinezdesembre/p1230455.jpg\" alt=\"p1230455\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenmart